OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and cloudy this
OL,6,Fmorning, some patchy rain in the
OL,7,Fnorthwest. This afternoon will be
OL,8,Fcloudy with some light and patchy rain
OL,9,Fspreading southeast for a time.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear periods across the
OL,12,Fnorth at first this evening. Otherwise
OL,13,Fa cloudy evening and night with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain spreading from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest. Light winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FOvernight rain soon clearing.
OL,18,FThen it will be a mostly dry day with
OL,19,Fsome sunny intervals developing by
OL,20,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
