OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and scattered showers on
OL,7,FWednesday. Dry for most of Thursday
OL,8,Fbut rain spreading east later. Cloudy
OL,9,Fand mainly dry on Friday.
